  "title": "eks-agent-platform operator chart values",
  "description": "Closed at every level Helm can check. A key this chart does not define is a key no template reads, and Helm's default behaviour is to accept it silently \u2014 which is how kx carried a webhooks.certManager block for a self-signed issuer that nothing provisions, and how two CI render flags set nothing while a comment claimed they exercised the alerting CRs. Nodes the templates pass through with toYaml stay open, because closing them would reject legitimate per-cluster input.",
